<ul><li>Multiple sensors are configured with different IDs and connected in series, and the ranging information of all sensors can be read through one communication interface. The connection diagram is as follows:<br /><a href="./File_TOF-CascadeRanging-1.jpg" class="image"><img alt="TOF-CascadeRanging-1.jpg" src="../w/upload/thumb/8/87/TOF-CascadeRanging-1.jpg/800px-TOF-CascadeRanging-1.jpg" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="800" height="128" srcset="../w/upload/8/87/TOF-CascadeRanging-1.jpg 1.5x" /></a></li></ul>
