							<a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="./TOF_Laser_Range_Sensor">
								Question: Can it be used under outdoor (strong light) conditions?

							</a>
						</h4>
					</div>
					<div id="accordion1" class="panel-collapse collapse in">
						<div class="panel-body">
<div>&#160;<b>Answer:</b></div>
<div>The module is affected by natural light. Generally speaking, the stronger the natural light, the greater the impact, which manifests as the shorter the ranging distance, the worse the accuracy, and the larger the fluctuation. Under strong light conditions (such as sunlight), it is generally recommended to use in close-range detection scenes.</div>
<div style="display:none;">{{{3}}}</div>
<div style="display:none;">{{{4}}}</div>
