<div>&#160;<b>Answer:</b></div>
<div>No interference. When multiple modules work at the same time, even if the infrared rays between each other cross or hit the same position, it will not affect the actual measurement.</div>
<div style="display:none;">{{{3}}}</div>
<div style="display:none;">{{{4}}}</div>
