						<h4 class="panel-title">
							<a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="./TOF_Laser_Range_Sensor">
								Question: Does the module support output point cloud information?

							</a>
						</h4>
					</div>
					<div id="accordion9" class="panel-collapse collapse in">
						<div class="panel-body">
<div>&#160;<b>Answer:</b></div>
<div>The module can only output one distance at a time and does not support the output of point cloud information temporarily.</div>
<div style="display:none;">{{{3}}}</div>
