						<h4 class="panel-title">
							<a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="./TOF_Laser_Range_Sensor">
								Question:  How can the module be turned off?

							</a>
						</h4>
					</div>
					<div id="accordion12" class="panel-collapse collapse in">
						<div class="panel-body">
<div>&#160;<b>Answer:</b></div>
<div>The module does not support a shutdown function. It currently operates in two modes—active output and query output—with a power consumption of approximately 290mW.
